{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Environmental News", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Our Environment", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Passive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are writing a news article or giving an interview, you can include the Simple Past Passive to describe something done by someone at sometime in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In a regular sentence structure, you use Subject + verb + object.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Scientists and academics founded many conservation organizations.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the Simple Past Passive form, you use the structure:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Object + <span class=\"italic\">was</span> / <span class=\"italic\">were</span> + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">by</span> Subject</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Many conservation organizations were founded by scientists and academics.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the Simple Past Passive to ask questions:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">Was</span> / <span class=\"italic\">Were</span> + Object + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">by</span> Subject</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Were you shocked by what you saw once you got there?</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences with <span class=\"italic\">If</span> Clause", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use the first conditional with If clauses to talk about real possibilities in the future.</p><p>You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do or not do something. In that condition, something else may, will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Second Conditional to talk about hypothetical situations. It's not certain that it's possible to fulfill the condition.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No. <br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past verb + <span class=\"italic\">would</span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">First Conditional:<br/>1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">First Conditional:<br/>2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we teach others about our environment,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">we will have a chance to save our planet.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible that we teach others about our environment. In this condition, we will have a chance to save our planet.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional:<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> ... + Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional:<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span> + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we continued on this path,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">the wildlife would soon go extinct. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is not certain that we will continue on this path. What would happen if it did? The wildlife would go extinct.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "conservationist ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who advocates the protection of the environment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tell us about your involvement as a conservationist, Jennifer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a conversation about conservation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "academic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a teacher or scholar ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Many conservation organizations were founded by scientists and academics.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shocked", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extremely surprised and upset", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Were you shocked by what you saw once you got there?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dismay", "type": "name"}, {"content": "consternation and distress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To our dismay, we saw how many trees were cut down every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "resource", "type": "name"}, {"content": "material or natural substance that can be collected for profit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To our dismay, we saw how many precious resources were taken away from the rainforest every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the short, soft hair of certain animals", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We were also unhappy to discover that endangered animals were sold for their skin and fur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "extinction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of a species becoming extinct", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we don't do anything, more animals and plants will face extinction.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Find a newspaper story online and underline all the uses of the simple past passive voice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an unusual newspaper headline. Example: <span class=\"italic\">Dog taught to drive</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a newspaper story using the simple past passive tense to go with the headline.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 10 to 12 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your story with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I  talk about feelings and impressions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  exchange opinions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  talk about cause and effect and hypothetical situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  identify news stories for discussion.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le17ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell us about your involvement as a conservationist, Jennifer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jennifer</span>: After I read all those articles online, I knew I needed to get involved. If I didn't act now, maybe my children would never be able to see the rainforest. Teachers like myself have a responsibility to the next generation. If we teach others about our environment, we will have a chance to save our planet. That's why many conservation organizations were founded by scientists and academics."}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Were you shocked by what you saw once you got there?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jennifer</span>: On my first trip, I was taken on a boat ride along the Amazon River for a week. Before beginning our journey down the river, we were shown several sites in the Peruvian Amazon. To our dismay, we saw how many precious resources were taken away from the rainforest every day. We were also unhappy to discover that endangered animals were sold for their skin and fur. I thought: if we continued on this path, the wildlife would soon go extinct."}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "60000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are you satisfied with your role as an activist? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jennifer</span>: There is much more that needs to be done before it's too late. We will soon find out if our organization gets its point across effectively. If it doesn't, more animals and plants will face extinction."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le17ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about feelings and impressions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can exchange opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect and hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What kind of awareness programs are there in your community?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Which environmental problem is the most dangerous for the environment right now? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "We need to get involved if we want to save our environment!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Sally finds out more about our environment! What is <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">lurking</span> on the horizon?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {